# The answer page runs its model on WebAssembly threads, which need a
# cross-origin-isolated page: COOP and COEP on the page and on its worker
# scripts. Only the answer page and llm/ get them, so nothing on the search
# page can be blocked by them. Everything the answer page loads from another
# origin (the pack and weights on R2, Google Fonts) is fetched with CORS.
/answer
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
/answer.html
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
/llm/*
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
